 class=\"mile-outcome\">\n              <div class=\"outcome-label\">Unlocked outcome</div>\n              <div class=\"outcome-copy\">A concrete basis for scalable deployment rather than a narrative-only raise</div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"ribbon\" aria-label=\"Use of funds ribbon\">\n          <div class=\"ribbon-title\">Use of funds</div>\n          <div class=\"fund-pill fund-1\"><strong>Team build</strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;implementation + product</div>\n          <div class=\"fund-pill fund-2\"><strong>Pilot launch</strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;site onboarding</div>\n          <div class=\"fund-pill fund-3\"><strong>Deployment support</strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;workflow integration</div>\n          <div class=\"fund-pill fund-4\"><strong>Validation</strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;usage, outcomes, ROI</div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"bottom-note\">\n          This is a finite, milestone-based raise: capital tied directly to hires, pilots, runway, and the validation needed to establish repeatable deployment.\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"footer-line\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n      <img\n        class=\"footer-logo\"\n        src=\"../../../../assets/logo/designer-health-logo-black.svg\"\n        alt=\"\"\n        aria-hidden=\"true\"\n      />\n    </section>\n  </body>\n</html>"
